          Return a JSON object containing the IPD measurement and coordinates (0-1000 scale).`
        },
        {
          inlineData: {
            mimeType: "image/jpeg",
            data: base64Image
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    config: {
      thinkingConfig: { thinkingBudget: 32768 },
      responseMimeType: "application/json",
